## 8. CONNECTION POOL (HIKARICP)

```yaml
# application.yml — HikariCP config
spring:
  datasource:
    hikari:
      minimum-idle:         ${DB_POOL_MIN:2}
      maximum-pool-size:    ${DB_POOL_MAX:10}
      idle-timeout:         300000    # 5 phút
      connection-timeout:   20000     # 20 giây
      max-lifetime:         1200000   # 20 phút (< PostgreSQL idle timeout)
      validation-timeout:   3000      # 3 giây
      connection-test-query: SELECT 1 # Validate connection
      pool-name: ${SERVICE_NAME:service}-HikariPool
      # Quan trọng: luôn set schema sau khi connect
      connection-init-sql: SET search_path TO ${DB_SCHEMA:public}
      data-source-properties:
        cachePrepStmts: true
        prepStmtCacheSize: 250
        prepStmtCacheSqlLimit: 2048
        useServerPrepStmts: true
```

